Anyway I thought a more detailed description would be available how this machine is in general intended to work. The stated 8 diagrams under "Precession" which show how to achieve thrust are of course nonsense and I'm sure you know that as well. Thank you anyway.<br>
<br>
Best regards,<br>
Harry<br><br></td></tr>
